   236	def test_a_killed_console_resumes_the_same_world(vehicle_stack):
   237	    """One recorded command, run before the kill: the resume replays its cycle and must not run it
   238	    again, so it ends with exactly one result. An unknown verb is refused, and a refusal is a
   239	    result. (A batch replaced inside a claim can be erased, vehicle #39; then no result appears
   240	    here at all and this fails saying so.)
